item.description:
Vérifier l'état de santé du serveur backend

MÉTHODE: GET /actuator/health
AUTHENTIFICATION: Non requise (Public)

RÉPONSE (200 OK):
{
  "status": "UP",
  "components": {
    "db": {
      "status": "UP",
      "details": {
        "database": "MySQL",
        "hello": 1
      }
    },
    "diskSpace": {
      "status": "UP",
      "details": {
        "total": 10737418240,
        "free": 5368709120,
        "threshold": 10485760,
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    "livenessState": {
      "status": "UP"
    },
    "readinessState": {
      "status": "UP"
    }
  }
}

RÉPONSE D'ERREUR (503 Service Unavailable):
{
  "status": "DOWN",
  "components": {
    "db": {
      "status": "DOWN",
      "details": {
        "error": "Connection refused"
      }
    }
  }
}
